/T (In this condition I met my close friend Henry Clerval, who had just arrived to begin his studies. At the sight of him, my feelings burst out, and I grasped his hand with wild joy. His presence brought me some comfort. He insisted on returning with me to my apartment, and I could not refuse.)
/E (In this condition I met my close friend Henry Clerval, who had just arrived to begin his studies. At the sight of him, my feelings burst out, and I grasped his hand with wild joy. His presence brought me some comfort. He insisted on returning with me to my apartment, and I could not refuse.)
